# Walkthrough segment 9: the trapped pail through Fairy Nuff's recipe.
#
# Continues walkthrough_08_from_village.xit. That trace leaves the score
# panel up on the meadow (102 points) with the bucket still on the path.
# Do not kick the bucket. Take it, then the published Nada route: the
# Eye Screen, the fairway tee, the green's egg, and Fairy Nuff's recipe.
#
# Clicks are move-then-click. The click holds the button across several
# polls, which is enough for a verb to register before the noun.

include walkthrough_08_from_village.xit

# Dismiss the 102-point panel. Checkmark measured on wt8_score.bmp.
move 165 123
click left
run 24

# Take the pail. A bare click kicks it, and it runs.
move 14 7
click left
move 226 96
click left
# Moving the cursor clears this line, so the checkpoint is taken
# on the pail. It reads the handle, the rock, and [7 points].
checkpoint wt9_pail
shot build/frames/wt9_pail.bmp
move 305 196
run 4

